5"],"facts":[{"id":"liusima-f2-0a814bdec1d36aab4fcd","text":"为成皋令，以病去；后迁元城令。","evidence":["liusima-q2-64fa6d34dd152bcb2586"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-c63b8a4993bb33cb6b49","text":"入为丞相主簿；其复井田之议未施行。","evidence":["liusima-q2-284a165db7a901bd86cd"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-aae86194befe16664c65","text":"明帝即位，封其子遗昌武亭侯；弟孚以子望继朗后。遗薨，望子洪嗣。","evidence":["liusima-q2-96a5a7f4254a2dadf8db"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-4c4c59194878d12de907","text":"《晋诸公赞》记望字子初，历司徒；入晋封义阳王，迁太尉、大司马；洪封河间王。","evidence":["liusima-q-dc173ee14dad76a19de5"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xunyu-m-p011-xunyu-p0024","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-p011"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o004-xunyu-p0024","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及司马朗","evidence":["wgc-q0004"]},{"id":"liusima-m2-05e6116ce3203e4dd920","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["liusima-q-8be3fa0ead320f7e34a7"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-fcce024a3679d81c858e","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-510c6e1e3f077d574c36","layer":"original","quote":"晋宣王方壮，琰谓朗曰：“子之弟，聪哲明允〖11〗，刚断英跱〖12〗，殆非子之所及也！”﹝三﹞朗以为不然，而琰每秉此论","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":13,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-07ffe09be97b4762e754","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-3cc1111157b9df035934","layer":"original","quote":"时岁大饥，人相食。朗收恤宗族，教训诸弟，不为衰世解业","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-18f5a7f9e0575d7d1801","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-578fb5ceebb1d4952484","layer":"original","quote":"或有告朗欲逃亡者，执以诣卓","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":56,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-1afe5f36470e2cf93fd1","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-578fb5ceebb1d4952484","layer":"original","quote":"卓谓朗曰：“卿与吾亡儿同岁，几大相负〖2〗！”朗因曰：“明公以高世之德，遭阳九之会〖3〗；清除群秽，广举贤士：此诚虚心垂虑，将兴至治也。威德已隆，功业已著；而兵难日起，州郡鼎沸；郊境之内，民不安业；捐弃居产，流亡藏窜；虽四关设禁〖4〗，重加刑戮，犹不绝息：此朗之所以於邑也〖5〗。愿明公监观往事，少加三思。即荣名并于日月，伊、周不足侔也〖6〗。”卓曰：“吾亦悟之，卿言有意","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":56,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":200,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-1cee386888cd37c3020b","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-0336d37562c8c3bef7ab","layer":"original","quote":"九岁，人有道其父字者。朗曰：“慢人亲者，不敬其亲者也。”客谢之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-2c1f4be8a47764993d39","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8a436e468788b6e1fd8f","layer":"original","quote":"迁兖州刺史，政化大行，百姓称之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-2d0d845987970bc00d3b","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-189d36a1f60878808479","layer":"original","quote":"监试者以其身体壮大，疑朗匿年〖2〗；劾问，朗曰：“朗之内外〖3〗，累世长大〖4〗。朗虽稚弱，无仰高之风；损年以求早成，非志所为也。”监试者异之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-3681026be3399bb26bbf","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-604d87922f69942da731","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗年二十二：据本传后文，司马朗死于建安二十二年（公元 217），终年四十七岁。又据本书卷一《武帝纪》，曹操开始任司空，时在建安元年（公元 196）。因此，司马朗出任司空掾属，最少也有二十六岁了。此处史文疑有误。","attribution":"现代注释","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f6eb1b3ae3830926fb3a","start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-37b970b5946000246b1a","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-3a2ad656b0ce7d58bacd","layer":"original","quote":"到，谓父老曰：“董卓悖逆，为天下所仇，此忠臣义士奋发之时也。郡与京都，境壤相接；洛东有成皋，北界大河；天下兴义兵者若未得进，其势必停于此。此乃四分五裂战争之地，难以自安。不如及道路尚通，举宗东到黎阳。黎阳有营兵〖8〗，赵威孙，乡里旧婚，为监营谒者〖9〗，统兵马，足以为主。若后有变，徐复观望，未晚也","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":30,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-47f1722a1124a805fb58","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-dc8a410b083c09f7ba94","layer":"original","quote":"军士大疫，朗躬巡视，致医药","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":77,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-49c46645fe8e1baf060d","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-0add6fe21912a1a7608a","layer":"original","quote":"复为堂阳长〖2〗。其治务宽惠，不行鞭杖，而民不犯禁","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-559cc61a99de438d3f7d","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8a436e468788b6e1fd8f","layer":"original","quote":"钟繇、王粲著论云：“非圣人不能致太平。”朗以为：“伊、颜之徒虽非圣人〖10〗，使得数世相承，太平可致","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":72,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-5dd7d29616436229af83","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-5778b1a53dfcfa202600","layer":"original","quote":"朗父防，为治书御史，当徙西。以四方云扰〖1〗，乃遣朗将家属还本县","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-67bc7b43e48842cca6cd","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-7967f52e91e783420954","layer":"original","quote":"边山之民果乱，内徙，或为寇抄","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":125,"end":139,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-6e07a1a3eeea577585be","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-dc8a410b083c09f7ba94","layer":"original","quote":"遇疾卒，时年四十七。遗命“布衣幅巾，敛以时服”。州人追思之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":77,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-7520acf2e4a71c977854","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-511f012c14f14dff5c5b","layer":"original","quote":"父老恋旧，莫有从者；惟同县赵咨，将家属俱与朗往焉","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-79f9ae20fa312f4ddd57","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-df5a4d7910ad8213601e","layer":"pei","quote":"年七十一，建安二十四年终。有子八人，朗最长，次即晋宣皇帝也","attribution":"裴注·司马彪《序传》","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-46984fbd12453c10cd4e","start":199,"end":228,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-7c43cc71103c1d0df186","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8f21f0889e9d5efbc671","layer":"pei","quote":"文帝善朗论，命秘书录其文","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-194ef8797517c78b5402","start":10,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-8be3fa0ead320f7e34a7","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-109b5cb1fd599f0cca80","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，封朗子遗，昌武亭侯，邑百户","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-9c2791e768c57d7d9edd","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2ce08139784fd3650026","layer":"original","quote":"又以为：“宜复井田〖5〗。往者以民各有累世之业〖6〗，难中夺之，是以至今。今承大乱之后，民人分散；土业无主，皆为公田：宜及此时复之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-b79f72ccd256bca71d0d","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-0add6fe21912a1a7608a","layer":"original","quote":"先时，民有徙充都内者。后县调当作船〖3〗，徙民恐其不办，乃相率私还助之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-bb428cf3035bb6c99b64","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-3a2ad656b0ce7d58bacd","layer":"original","quote":"朗知卓必亡，恐见留；即散财物以赂遗卓用事者〖7〗，求归乡里","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-c1ba59412e9ccef2112c","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-8a436e468788b6e1fd8f","layer":"original","quote":"乡人李觌等盛得名誉，朗常显贬下之。后觌等败，时人服焉","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":45,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-cc437f7b23f80c7e143a","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-7967f52e91e783420954","layer":"original","quote":"故冀州刺史李邵，家居野王，近山险，欲徙居温。朗谓邵曰：“唇齿之喻，岂唯虞、虢〖5〗？温与野王即是也。今去彼而居此，是为避朝亡之期耳〖6〗。且君，国人之望也。今寇未至而先徙，带山之县必骇。是摇动民之心而开奸宄之原也！窃为郡内忧之。”邵不从","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":6,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-d504da98e8112d2cce1b","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-0add6fe21912a1a7608a","layer":"original","quote":"年二十二〖1〗，太祖辟为司空掾属","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-db9574cd247cd6a2e461","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-3cc1111157b9df035934","layer":"original","quote":"朗乃将家还温","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-dc173ee14dad76a19de5","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-db3acd5e128b37d91d98","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《晋诸公赞》曰：“望字子初，孚之长子。有才识，早知名。咸熙中，位至司徒。入晋，封义阳王；迁太尉、大司马。时孚为太宰，父子居上公位，自中代以来未之有也。洪字孔业，封河间王。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见引句）","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c713ac70da30de166566","start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-dda48258453b931583f6","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2ce08139784fd3650026","layer":"original","quote":"朗以为：“天下土崩之势，由秦灭五等之制，而郡国无蒐狩习战之备故也〖4〗。今虽五等未可复行，可令州郡并置兵：外备四夷，内威不轨，于策为长","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":7,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-e4a5f22eba32fa1bc53c","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-dc8a410b083c09f7ba94","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十二年，与夏侯惇、臧霸等征吴，到居巢","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":77,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-f2f941cb1dffce930976","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-e499447343fae45f1a00","layer":"pei","quote":"朗临卒，谓将士曰：‘刺史蒙国厚恩，督司万里。微功未效，而遭此疫疠。既不能自救，辜负国恩。身没之后，其布衣幅巾，敛以时服。勿违吾志也","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1a7be65ebb6523af4754","start":10,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-f539766f10107a3478bc","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-189d36a1f60878808479","layer":"original","quote":"十二，试经，为童子郎","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q2-284a165db7a901bd86cd","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2ce08139784fd3650026","layer":"original","quote":"入为丞相主簿。朗以为：“天下土崩之势，由秦灭五等之制，而郡国无蒐狩习战之备故也〖4〗。今虽五等未可复行，可令州郡并置兵：外备四夷，内威不轨，于策为长。”又以为：“宜复井田〖5〗。往者以民各有累世之业〖6〗，难中夺之，是以至今。今承大乱之后，民人分散；土业无主，皆为公田：宜及此时复之。”议虽未施行〖7〗，然州郡领兵，朗本意也。","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q2-64fa6d34dd152bcb2586","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-0add6fe21912a1a7608a","layer":"original","quote":"年二十二〖1〗，太祖辟为司空掾属。除成皋令，以病去。复为堂阳长〖2〗。其治务宽惠，不行鞭杖，而民不犯禁。先时，民有徙充都内者。后县调当作船〖3〗，徙民恐其不办，乃相率私还助之。其见爱如此。迁元城令。","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q2-96a5a7f4254a2dadf8db","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-109b5cb1fd599f0cca80","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，封朗子遗，昌武亭侯，邑百户。朗弟孚，又以子望，继朗后。遗薨，望子洪嗣。﹝三﹞","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-ec8ddf9872852bdd6d5f","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"行遇霖雨，大军先（及）〔反〕；水遂长，贼船稍（进）〔近〕，将士皆不安。辽欲去，霸止之曰：“公明于利钝〖22〗，宁肯捐吾等邪〖23〗！”明日果有令","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":186,"end":258,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-ed4bde62e4ba2c7f37ae","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"霸从讨孙权于濡须口，与张辽为前锋","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":169,"end":185,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-fefc63f7ccc2428b8d9c","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"辽至，以语太祖。太祖善之，拜扬威将军〖25〗，假节","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":263,"end":288,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0004","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-dfd6d68a0f7a8f5f94dc","layer":"original","quote":"仍徙为扬、豫州刺史〖8〗，咸得军民之欢心。始至豫州，旌先贤之后〖9〗，求未显之士；各有条教〖10〗，意义甚美。初，凌与司马朗、贾逵友善〖11〗，及临兖、豫，继其名迹〖12〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o185a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e821a23c7f404685c92","layer":"original","quote":"二十二年春正月〖1〗，王军居巢〖2〗。二月，进军屯江西郝溪〖3〗。权在濡须口筑城，拒守。遂逼攻之，权退走。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":379,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-f23b885c4cc219692803","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f23b885c4cc219692803","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十二年：建安二十二年（公元 217）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4fc85cb108cb7e71f49d","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o185","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e821a23c7f404685c92","layer":"original","quote":"二十二年春正月〖1〗，王军居巢〖2〗。二月，进军屯江西郝溪〖3〗。权在濡须口筑城，拒守。遂逼攻之，权退走。三月，王引军还，留夏侯惇、曹仁、张辽等屯居巢。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":379,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o031a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-89f18ed57ac537b291ca","layer":"original","quote":"二十一年冬〖1〗，曹公次于居巢〖2〗，遂攻濡须。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p011","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-21873455cc9461d16e3e","layer":"pei","quote":"又《平原祢衡传》曰：“衡字正平。建安初，自荆州北游许都。恃才傲逸，臧否过差；见不如己者，不与语，人皆以是憎之。唯少府孔融，高贵其才，上书荐之曰：‘淑质贞亮，英才卓荦。初涉艺文，升堂睹奥。目所一见，辄诵于口；耳所暂闻，不忘于心。性与道合，思若有神。弘羊心计，安世默识；以衡准之，诚不足怪。’衡，时年二十四。是时许都虽新建，尚饶人士。衡尝书一刺怀之，字漫灭而无所适。或问之曰：‘何不从陈长文、司马伯达乎？’衡曰：‘卿欲使我从屠沽儿辈也！’又问曰：‘当今许中，谁最可者？’衡曰：‘大儿有孔文举，小儿有杨德祖。’又问：‘曹公、荀令君、赵荡寇，皆足盖世乎？’衡称曹公不甚多；又见荀有仪容，赵有腹尺，因答曰：‘文若可借面吊丧，稚长可使监厨请客。’其意以为荀但有貌，赵健啖肉也。于是众人皆切齿。衡知众不悦，将南还荆州；装束临发，众人为祖道。先设供帐于城南，自共相诫曰：‘衡数不逊，今因其后到，以不起，报之。’及衡至，众人皆坐不起。衡乃嚎啕大哭，众人问其故。衡曰：‘行尸柩之间，能不悲乎？’衡南见刘表，表甚礼之。将军黄祖屯夏口；祖子射，与衡善，随到夏口。祖嘉其才，每在坐，席有异宾，介使与衡谈。后衡骄蹇，答祖言‘俳优饶言’。祖以为骂己也，大怒；顾伍伯捉头出。左右遂扶以去，拉而杀之。”","attribution":"《平原祢衡传》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":79,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5cdbaf6b01ad416ab88","start":0,"end":534,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o085c-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-1827f70f66ba5b4938c3","layer":"original","quote":"后曹公又大出濡须，权以蒙为督；据前所立坞，置强弩万张于其上，以拒曹公。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":40,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-f4162f0691f201c0e391","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-d709736c5ad98893d629","layer":"original","quote":"曹公出濡须，然备大坞及三关屯〖3〗，拜偏将军","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
